  "slug": "notchkit",
  "name": "Notchkit",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Build macOS notch apps that live in the MacBook camera notch. Handles the hard parts — notch detection, floating panel (NSPanel), hover expand/collapse animations, the curved NotchShape, and a SwiftUI template with collapsed wings + expanded tray. Clone, edit one file, build. No Xcode project needed.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, `build-notch-app` (Build macOS notch apps that live in the MacBook camera notch).\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install notchkit@claude-community` from `aishwaryaashok14/notch-kit`.\n\nAn agent skill for building macOS notch apps. Install it once, and any AI coding agent can build a notch app in minutes.",
